{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13212260","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13212260","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1321226001:1":{"text":"今日は最高の日だ！勇気を持って踏み出して本当によかった！","source_cn":"天哪！幸好最后一刻见到了阿托卡大师。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CCA844E80C87D1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1321226002:1":{"text":"もしこの機会を逃していたら……僕は一生後悔してた！","source_cn":"如果错过……我肯定追悔终身！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0468A61C91EF246","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321226003:1":{"text":"雪だるまさんに感謝ですね！","source_cn":"你要感谢小雪人哦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BC98B96BA83E0B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321226004:1":{"text":"うん。彼が背中を押してくれなかったら、僕はまだあれこれ悩んでたはずだ。","source_cn":"还好小雪人推了我一把，不然我肯定还在纠结细节。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCFCE10451D6DF74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321226005:1":{"text":"これまでの僕は完璧を求めすぎて、いつまでも行動に移せない。","source_cn":"觉得一定要改到自己满意，才敢出手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF785E71D91B533A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321226006:1":{"text":"その結果、あらゆる機会を逃し……","source_cn":"结果一拖再拖……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1E21E008EC49269","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321226007:1":{"text":"今回はオイラのおかげで間に合ったけど、これからは自分でそのく……癖を乗り越えるんだぞ！","source_cn":"多亏了咱吧！你该治……治治这个毛病了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x195FFF83FB219D6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321226008:1":{"text":"先延ばし症候群といって、学名もついてるんですよ。","source_cn":"这有个学名，叫拖延症。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B4A5D328B909C3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321226009:1":{"text":"雪だるまさんの行動力は、すごい特効薬になりそうです。","source_cn":"小雪人这种行动派呢，专治拖延症。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BF46F98463570DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1321226010:1":{"text":"彼の場合、少し焦りすぎの感はありますが。","source_cn":"干啥都急吼吼的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x187B69D56760B638","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1321226011:1":{"text":"オイラの……命は……短いと言っただろう！だから……一分、一秒を……争う！","source_cn":"因……为咱生命短……暂呀！要争分夺……秒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BB97D311A44500D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1321226012:1":{"text":"どうしてそんなに、途切れ途切れに話すのですか！","source_cn":"你怎么说话断断续续的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0B31BFB1AF667A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1321226013:1":{"text":"そういえば、お花が見たいと言ってましたよね？この景色素敵じゃないですか！？","source_cn":"你不是念叨着想看花吗？这里景色不错吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9301194793327B57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1321226014:1":{"text":"これが……花！すごくきれい！","source_cn":"野……花！好看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB15710700807FE46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:画家派特":{"text":"画家のパルト","source":"画家派特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:雪人":{"text":"雪だるま","source":"雪人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":4}}